<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-nineteen-foundations"><h4 id="topic-nineteen-foundations"><?php echo s($bloodtext('Invigorate Blood and move Blood stasis: general introduction','Mover Sangre y resolver estasis: introducción general'));?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($bloodtext('The exam first asks whether pain is fixed and stabbing, color is purple/dark, clots or masses are present, and symptoms resist pressure. Then choose temperature, strength and secondary action.','El examen primero pregunta si dolor es fijo/punzante, color púrpura/oscuro, existen coágulos o masas y síntomas resisten presión. Luego elige temperatura, fuerza y acción secundaria.'));?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__decision"><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtext('Trauma / pain','Trauma / dolor'));?></strong><span>Ru Xiang · Mo Yao</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtext('Heat + stasis','Calor + estasis'));?></strong><span>Yu Jin · Chi Shao · Dan Shen</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtext('Hard mass','Masa dura'));?></strong><span>E Zhu</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($bloodtext('Lower body / water','Parte inferior / agua'));?></strong><span>Niu Xi · Ze Lan</span></div></div><aside class="single-herbs-guide__memory-path"><p class="single-herbs-guide__memory-line"><?php echo s($bloodtext('Enter the city’s red-traffic repair crew.','Entra al equipo que repara el tráfico rojo de la ciudad.'));?></p><p><?php echo s($bloodtext('Tao Ren breaks the jam and oils the bowel. Chi Shao cools the red lane. Ru Xiang opens Qi first; Mo Yao breaks fixed Blood. Niu Xi sends traffic down. Jiang Huang repairs the shoulder route. Dan Shen cools the Heart intersection. E Zhu drills masses. Yu Jin unlocks Heart and Gallbladder. Ze Lan drains the swamp around the red river.','Tao Ren rompe atasco y aceita intestino. Chi Shao enfría carril rojo. Ru Xiang abre Qi; Mo Yao rompe Sangre fija. Niu Xi envía tráfico abajo. Jiang Huang repara ruta del hombro. Dan Shen enfría cruce de Corazón. E Zhu perfora masas. Yu Jin abre Corazón/Vesícula. Ze Lan drena pantano alrededor del río rojo.'));?></p></aside><p class="single-herbs-guide__scope-note"><strong><?php echo s($bloodtext('Name normalization:','Normalización del nombre:'));?></strong> <?php echo s($bloodtext('“Ru Xian” is shown as the standard pinyin Ru Xiang. “Niu Xi” remains generic because that is how it appears in the current guideline.','“Ru Xian” se muestra con pinyin estándar Ru Xiang. “Niu Xi” permanece genérico porque así aparece en el guideline actual.'));?></p><ol class="single-herbs-guide__category-herbs"><?php foreach($bloodherbs as $h):?><li class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb single-herbs-guide__category-herb--core"><div class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-head"><strong><?php echo s($h['name']);?></strong><em><?php echo s($h['latin']);?></em><span class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge"><?php echo s($bloodtext('Current category list','Lista vigente de la categoría'));?></span></div><p><?php echo s($h['identity']);?></p></li><?php endforeach;?></ol></section>
<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-nineteen-yang"><h4 id="topic-nineteen-yang"><?php echo s($bloodtext('Yang comparative fingerprints','Huellas comparativas de Yang'));?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($bloodtext('Relative study indices from chapter 11—not doses or clinical percentages. Only current-list herbs are graphed.','Índices relativos del capítulo 11—no dosis ni porcentajes clínicos. Solo se grafican hierbas de la lista actual.'));?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__yang-charts"><?php foreach($bloodcharts as $chart):?><article class="single-herbs-guide__yang-chart"><h5><?php echo s($chart[0]);?></h5><small><?php echo s($chart[1]);?></small><?php foreach($chart[2] as $name=>$value):?><div class="single-herbs-guide__yang-bar"><span><?php echo s($name);?></span><span class="single-herbs-guide__yang-bar-track"><span class="single-herbs-guide__yang-bar-fill" style="width:<?php echo(int)$value;?>%"></span></span><b><?php echo(int)$value;?></b></div><?php endforeach;?></article><?php endforeach;?></div><p class="single-herbs-guide__yang-note"><strong><?php echo s($bloodtext('Boundary note:','Nota de límite:'));?></strong> <?php echo s($bloodtext('Yang’s complete figures include many herbs outside this current Board category. They are intentionally omitted rather than mixed into the graphs.','Las figuras completas de Yang incluyen muchas hierbas fuera de esta categoría Board. Se omiten intencionalmente en vez de mezclarlas en las gráficas.'));?></p></section>
